        "original_id": "758b5953-1f1d-56d7-9ca7-80e44d6a9369",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Luke Rockhold, Chris Weidman, Jamill Kelly, Anderson Silva, Daniel Cormier, Cain Velasquez\n- Organizations: UFC, American Kickboxing Academy\n- Roles: Middleweight Champion, wrestling coach\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Chris Weidman became the first man to defeat Anderson Silva inside the UFC and became the Middleweight Champion.\n- Chris Weidman held the Middleweight Champion title for approximately two and a half years.\n- In 2015, Jamill Kelly became a guest wrestling coach for Daniel Cormier, Luke Rockhold, and Cain Velasquez at the American Kickboxing Academy.\n- On December 12, 2015, Luke Rockhold won the title by defeating the previously undefeated champion Chris Weidman via fourth-round TKO.",
